PLACEHOLDER - not real agenix ciphertext.

This file exists so `nixosConfigurations.rocky` evaluates and builds
before the rocky box (and its host key) exist. It is NOT decryptable.
Before the first deploy, replace it with a real encrypted secret:

  cd secrets
  # after recipients.txt carries the real operator + rocky host keys:
  agenix -e linear-api-key.age   # paste the ROC Linear OAuth token

The fleet reads the decrypted value by file path at activation
(matters.linear.credentialFiles.api_key); it never lands in the nix
store or the unit environment. See docs/deploy.md.
